  "title": "Google Announces Personalized Gemini AI for Car Integration",
  "summary": "Google introduces a more personalized version of its Gemini AI assistant for cars, allowing it to access Google services like Gmail, Calendar, Maps, and Photos to provide tailored responses while driving.",
